<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2641_10251.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unßer fründtlich, willig dienst und gruoß zuovor,
<lb n="2"/>ehrwürdige, wolgelehrte, frome, veste, fürsichtige,
<lb n="3"/>fürneme und wyße, innsonnders günstige liebe herren
<lb n="4"/>und vertrüwte liebe Eydt: und Pundtsgnoßen.
<lb n="5"/>Allß dato diß, vor unß erschinnen, <persName resp="#ner">Anna Schnidin</persName>,
<lb n="6"/>ein dienstmagt alhie, hat sy im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rächt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzeígen</unclear> laßen,
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Anndres</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fryßig</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kupferschmid</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsell</unclear> von
<lb n="8"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St: Gallen</placeName>, üwer burger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgäben</unclear>, als er by
<lb n="9"/>Meister <persName resp="#ner">Heinnrichen Kambli</persName> dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kupferschmid</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">by</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedienet</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">arbeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gstannden</unclear>, die
<lb n="11"/>ehe gmuotet und endtlich mit mund und hand verlobt und ver-
<lb n="12"/>sprochen, sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dahin</unclear> vermögen, daß sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bylags</unclear>, unnder eelichem schyn zuo willen, irer jungk-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frowenschaft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verfelt</unclear> und gschwängered worden, do
<lb n="15"/>er hinen verreißen wellen habe er gseit, daß sy nienen
<lb n="16"/>andst dann Gott scheiden sölle, er welle bald wider kom-
<lb n="17"/>en, und sy eelichen zuo kirchen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">straßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuehren</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">synem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versprächen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thue</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">über</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zyth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußbliben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seige</unclear> ir gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnderthenig</unclear> und de-
<lb n="20"/>muetig begären, iren mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebürendem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rächten</unclear> ver-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hülfflich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syn</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derenwägen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßere</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">L</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. und Pundtsgnoßen, unnßer fründtlich-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begären</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obanngedüten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Anndres</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fryßig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dahin</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> halten, das er alhie, alda daß eeliche versprächen
<lb n="25"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bylag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschächen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschynen</unclear>, und iren uff <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">donstag</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>den .2. tag deß bald komenden Augstmonats</date>, morg-
<lb n="27"/>ens by guoter zyth, im rächten bscheid und antwort
<lb n="28"/>gäbe.
<lb n="29"/>Daß begärend wir umb üch, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">G</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">L</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pundtsgnoßen</unclear> inn annderen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tragenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begäbenheiten</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2641_10252.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverdienen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thuond</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samptlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gottes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnediger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erhaltung</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolbevehlen</unclear>.
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Geben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> . <origDate when="1627-07-19" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">19</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">July</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Anno</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1627</unclear></origDate> .
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eherichter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Landschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zürich</unclear>.
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unser</unclear> freündtlich willig dienst und gruoß zuvor,
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrwürdig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgelehrte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fromm</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Veste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Füersichtige</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrsame</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weise</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsonnders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Freünd</unclear>,
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pundtsgnoßen</unclear>.
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Was</unclear> ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">19</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tl</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Julij</unclear></date> diß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgers</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Andreas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Beisigs</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tuchschrhandts</unclear>, an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehe</unclear>-
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gricht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrifftlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanngen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, haben wir ablesend
<lb n="44"/>wol verstanden, Unnd daruf nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermanglet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedachten</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Beisigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuofordern</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wessen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear>
<lb n="46"/>der besagten <persName resp="#ner">Anna Schmidin</persName> beklagt worden,
<lb n="47"/>zred zuosetzen. Unnd obgleich wol er der Vermischung,
<lb n="48"/>zuo welcher sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anlaaß</unclear> solle geben haben,
<lb n="49"/>zwar wol gstendig geiwsen, aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eheversprechung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear>-
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khanndtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> wellen, dahero wir nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear>,
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> die sach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grund</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschaffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mög</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> aber sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nohmahln</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möchte</unclear>
<lb n="53"/>sie hette an ihne ein rechtmeßige Eheliche annsprach:
<lb n="54"/>So solle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Recht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehegricht</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2641_10253.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="55"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gstalt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">offen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stehn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear>
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtens</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuochen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">möege</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihro</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füerderlich</unclear>
<lb n="57"/>und gebüerend recht eruolgen, zuo welchem end
<lb n="58"/>hin wir ihne mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eedtspflicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">belegt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> er vor
<lb n="59"/>ußtrag der sachen von hie sich nit begeben solle.
<lb n="60"/>Volten wir üech unsern getrüwen lieb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eedt</unclear>- und
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pundtsgnoßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhalten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verblie</unclear>-
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üech</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eedtgnöesischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diensten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iederzeit</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bißgethon</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zumal</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Göttlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">protection</unclear>
<lb n="64"/>wol beuelchend. Dat. <origDate when="1627-07-23" resp="#ner">23ten Julii. 1627</origDate>.
<lb n="65"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rhat
<lb n="66"/>der Statt St. Gallen</orgName>
<lb n="67"/>Dem Eherwüerdigen wolgelerten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fromen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vesten</unclear>,
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Füersichtigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ersamen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wisen</unclear> herren, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ruchtern</unclear>
